Comment: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:21.78,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:28.79,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char boldly infiltrated Jaburo,\Nthe Earth Federation Forces Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.37,0:01:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, with the heroic efforts\Nof Katz, Letz, and Kikka...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and with the Gundam's fierce pursuit,\NChar had no choice but to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:56.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That damn Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:08.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Tianem Fleet will be\Ndeparting Jaburo at 2100 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would like your White Base to leave\Ntwo hours before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:15.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A full two hours ahead, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's correct. Oh, we'll be sending\Nthree other decoy ships as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're having the Tianem Fleet\Nhead straight for Luna II...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...while the White Base takes the opposite\Nsatellite orbital course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we'll move in to attack\NZeon's space fortress, Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base will depart\Nat 1900 hours today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:42.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign Mirai, take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:48.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once Solomon falls,\NZeon's resources will be so low...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:53.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...they will inevitably ask for peace\Nnegotiations, and the war will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll let me find you a husband then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.63,0:03:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1383.86,956)}´
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:03:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. That's right, you have a fiance.\NForgive my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1160,958)}´
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He may be my fiance, but\Nit was arranged by our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:14.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that he fled to Side 6\Nto avoid the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to face it sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base will be departing in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have all stations ready to go by then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo! Who's in charge of\Nthe White Base crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:36.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just tell me where he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright! You're wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:45.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Sleggar Law.\NI've just been transferred here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:46.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai. Have we been notified?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:50.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:55.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My luck must be improving,\Nif I get to work with such a lovely lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greetings. I'm Mirai Yashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:05.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Sayla Mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like you're troubled\Nabout some other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, where do I bunk down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The first step to this great battle{\i}\N{\i1}relies on your courageous actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should the Federation Forces{\i}\N{\i1}emerge from this battle victorious...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...then our people will remember today{\i}\N{\i1}as a turning point in history.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We pray that you will fight well.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a great big guy\Njust like Mr. Ryu was before he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's as nice as Ryu though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard he's smart mouthed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, we'll be taking off soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands to your stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:48.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Release the docking locks!\NWhite Base, take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Airspace clear! Open hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at all the birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look to portside if you have a minute.\NIt's a flock of flamingos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll record it on video.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, you have my authorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the Trojan Horse up to, Lt. Tokwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:09.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems they've left Jaburo\Nin South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be within combat range in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was Lady Kycilia quite upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought as much...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:07:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this Zanzibar hadn't been standing by to test the Bigro I couldn't have pursued the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:01.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see the Bigro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, show it to me.\NI need to come up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:12.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When it comes to high speed combat,\Nthis Bigro mobile armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...puts mobile suits to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:19.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't build a battle plan\Naround one machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. But we've also got two Doms\Nand an untested mobile armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doms? Aren't they for land combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes sir! But these are Rick Doms\Nwith powered-up verniers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've been remodeled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Much more effective than Zaku-types.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:36.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speed it up!\NWe'll be heading out soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Assemble the pilots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As soon as we know where\Nthe Trojan Horse is headed, we'll attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ship pursuing us looks like\Na Zanzibar-class warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this rate, they'll catch up in 20 minutes\Nand we'll be under direct attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:56.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Stay on this course\Nand accelerate at Point E3.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:08:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. That way it'll look like the White Base\Nis heading straight toward the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:04.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll come for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla, what are you still doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's barely time to check the G-Armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you be sure that Char is coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:21.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because... There's some fateful attraction\Nbetween him and the White Base. Right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:33.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think she's tired,\Nand that's why she's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have the Trojan Horse's projected course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're headed for the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:48.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the moon?! Are they after\NLady Kycilia's Granada base?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:48.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:49.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:54.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse is just a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's probably a different fleet\Ntaking off from Jaburo right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we have to change course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:05.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious? If we turn our backs\Non the Trojan Horse, they'll attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to launch a preemptive strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zanzibar located! Maximum magnification.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many minutes until they attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll be under attack\Nin 2 minutes, 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro and Sayla!\NPrepare to launch in the G-Sky and G-Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have the Guncannon ready on standby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open all gun turrets!\NOpen beam cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tokwan, are you ready to launch the Bigro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick Doms, prepare to launch next!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tokwan and two others, launching now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}G-Sky, G-Bull Easy, take off at once!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:02.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Deploy to the White Base's rear{\i}\N{\i1}and destroy the enemy mobile suits!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks to me like you're troubled{\i}\N{\i1}about some other guy.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:12.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're doing this to take revenge\Non the Zabi family...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I can't approve of that way of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}G-Sky! Here I go!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Bull Easy, launching now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:32.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla, distance yourself a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we took a direct hit right now,\Nthey could destroy both of us at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be careful now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you go too fast,\Ngravity will make you plummet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:47.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember to fly as if you were ascending.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:54.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rear missiles, intercept quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right... just you watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:08.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you evade the speed of my Bigro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how powerful it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's gripping me at a poor angle.\NI'll use my beam cannons...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... what if my brother\Nis piloting this mobile armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No, Ms. Sayla, you've got to ascend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three enemy mobile suits confirmed.\NPlease send out the Guncannon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Have Kai launch the Guncannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Lieutenant Sleggar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah? What is it? I'm right below the bridge.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you specialize in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Artillery, fighter craft, take your pick!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:00.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you take care of\Nthe main cannons, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:01.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On one condition.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Turn the White Base toward the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're in inertial flight,\Nso you should be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then they'd catch up with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:14.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I won't do it.{\i}\N{\i1}I'm not confident that I'd hit anything.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:34.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen well. Just attack for 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if we fire any longer than that, we risk\Nshooting down our own mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:47.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't looking good...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:49.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll get them with the guns at the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse has gotten better...\NI wonder if they have a new captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A civilian entering the military and\Njoining the Trojan Horse crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Artesia...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Artesia...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the last time I saw her,{\i}\N{\i1}she was wearing a military uniform.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:18.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Artesia, who was intelligent,{\i}\N{\i1}and hated wars more than anyone.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way she'd board\Na space warship again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Halt your fire in three seconds!\NHit your mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. That wasn't on purpose at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lieutenant Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant. Let me remind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that you may be older than me\Nbut I still have command authority. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:53.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turn about to starboard so that I can use\Nthe White Base's main cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't right now!\NWait a little longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:01.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The power isn't increasing... Why?!\NIt doesn't rev up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.37,0:14:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rear missiles!\NFiring angle, plus 12 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:13.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph! This is how you\Nput up a barrage of missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's maneuvered beneath me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Talk about guts!\NIf you keep coming below me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you could be pulled down. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of the three enemy machines\Nis a mobile armor class weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please hurry with the Guncannon's launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! What's taking you so long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right! It's a long story, but I'm ready{\i}\N{\i1}and the catapult's okay!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go back up Amuro and Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:57.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger that! Here I go!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Secure the Guntank to the launch exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll use it as a gun turret! Got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that! I'll inform Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring the White Base about 180 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Lieutenant Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:19.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about taking over at the main cannons?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai, I'll leave the ship in your hands.\NI'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, where could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't spend the rest of my life\Nbeing depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't know how Ms. Sayla and Amuro\Ncan keep fighting like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got the upper hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.49,0:16:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll use this opportunity\Nto transfer to Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:15.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, I've got to lower its speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:17.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A direct hit and she's gone...\Nbut I've gotta stop her from plummeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready? I'm starting docking procedures!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. But hurry up, Amuro.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:44.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, what kind of person do you think\Nis piloting that mobile armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:48.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! A Dom is coming, so hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:55.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:56.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay! Don't worry, I'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Fighter! Docking now complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altitude of mobile suit combat decreasing.\NWe can open fire on enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for fleet combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:22.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad we can't use our J-type missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll attack them as we evade their fire!\NAim carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Entering firing range in 30 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who has the longer firing range...\Nus or the Trojan Horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose only God knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:41.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Artesia, I assume you're not on board...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Evade their fire every three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Entering firing range in 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:53.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can fire in 20 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,15 seconds! All hands, prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:18:02.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how powerful\Nthe White Base's main cannons might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}3...2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes! Return fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't fire yet! Lure them in, and then fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:22.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire missiles continuously!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:29.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You persevered well! Now fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Zanzibar...\NI'll shoot you down somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now! Head for the Trojan Horse\Non a collision course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But sir...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:47.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be less likely to get hit than\Nif we weave about. I guarantee it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:47.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:51.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zanzibar isn't evading fire!\NThey're on a collision course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're doing what?!\NMirai, evade! Starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who would dare\Nto use these tactics!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just as Sayla said! Char's come after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse is losing its nerve!\NArtillery, take good aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:12.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:28.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?!\NThat's for trying to ram into my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire rear missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up... or running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd the other Dom go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:02.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The faster it is, the less accurate the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what a Bigro can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? I've picked up some baggage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be the Gundam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, if it is... the pilot would have fainted\Nfrom the sudden acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible! Didn't the pilot pass out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are the other mobile suits\Nand the Zanzibar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of their mobile suits has retreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:24.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They destroyed Tokwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please let me go after them, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.19,0:21:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're like a baby bird\Nthat's wandered into our yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There'll be plenty more chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now get started on repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:42.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla.\NWhy did you ask about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:42.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back there, you asked who I thought\Nwas piloting the mobile armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that the enemy was so tough...\NThat's the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can declare this first stage a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:22:00.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree. I think we were\Nable to mislead the Zanzibar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impressive, Lieutenant Sleggar.\NYou were the only one with a direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.01,0:22:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was just a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm more impressed by how you all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Good work, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:13.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's gotten faster, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:18.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was scary when we passed the Zanzibar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those seemed like Char's tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.11,0:22:21.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody else could've pulled that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man... I really do admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla, you shot down a mobile suit!\NThat's quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on I just barely...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.11,0:22:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play it down. I can tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're an incredibly strong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm going to take a quick shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you've only got five minutes.\NZeon will be back in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that! Wanna join me, Ms. Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.03,0:22:49.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to go on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.27,0:22:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.93,0:22:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Sure.\N- Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- We're coming with you!\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After shaking off Char's heated pursuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:26.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the White Base is met by\Na Musai fleet, led by Lieutenant Dren.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.17,0:23:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sleggar desperately fights them off...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and the Gundam stages a fearless charge\Nagainst the Musais.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NBreakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
